The bandwidth estimation orchestrators, the bitrate allocator, and
several additional classes, as well as other components of the mediasoup
BWE stack, have been implemented from scratch. However, most of the core
congestion control and bandwidth estimation logic is derived from the
libwebrtc component of the WebRTC project.

The BWE source code in mediasoup is distributed under the copyright and
license terms specified in the LICENSE file located in the mediasoup
root directory.

To acknowledge and preserve the copyright notices and licensing terms
of libwebrtc and the WebRTC project, the corresponding license text is
reproduced below.

